{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_011CdosqBbkMHayN4EsTzm32","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The key factors to weigh: **migration cost** (how much history/data you can carry over and how much you'll lose or have to manually move), **workflow fit** (does the new tool support your actual process — sprints, kanban, custom fields, automations — without forcing awkward workarounds), and **integration surface** (GitHub/Slack/CI hooks, API quality, and what breaks on your current toolchain). The hidden cost is usually team adoption friction — a tracker people don't use consistently is worse than an imperfect one they do.\n\nWhat's driving the switch? That'd help me give a more targeted take on which tradeoffs actually matter here."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7816,"cache_read_input_tokens":19604,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7816},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7dbdae08-2c9a-48f2-b543-387103debae6","uuid":"2c2db2eb-2b98-44d8-9176-100dade415c0","timestamp":"2026-08-07T18:40:33.217Z","request_id":"req_011Cdosq7o3dczM58zZ7vWrz"}
